# Overview

This is a program that is a basic client server chatroom that is to show my beginner understanding of Networking using the Python language

You run both Client and Server in a dedicated terminal to use the chatroon

I wanted to create a simple chat room with an open port

[Software Demo Video](https://youtu.be/yU_9mjXlUCQ)

# Network Communication

client/server

TCP and port 5000

UTF-8 

# Development Environment

Claude (for bugs and understanding code previously not understood)
VS Code

Python
Threading
Socket

